Mutation
- [N11] Node-level mutation: element=action(n12,"does HR services receive the documentation"); source=i10:HR services receive the documentations and this marks the end of the process.; reason=The source states receipt as a definitive fact concluding the process, but the model reframes it as an interrogative condition ('does HR services receive...'), altering the deterministic nature of the step.
- [N12] Node-level mutation: element=action(n17,"is there any variation again"); source=i13:However, if there are variations, a business case is completed and attached.; reason=Introduces interrogative phrasing and the concept of repetition ('again') not present in the corresponding source unit, drifting from the declarative conditional structure of the text.

